# Leave empty when the API is reached through the same origin
# (Vite dev proxy, or Express serving the built app). Recommended.
# Set it only when the API is hosted on a different domain, e.g.
# VITE_API_URL=https://ambulance-api.example.com
# (then also set COOKIE_SAMESITE=none and CLIENT_URL on the server).
VITE_API_URL=
